WEBVTT

00:02.522 --> 00:03.563
Water...

00:04.816 --> 00:06.108
Earth...

00:06.859 --> 00:08.193
Fire...

00:09.070 --> 00:10.320
Air.

00:11.364 --> 00:15.284
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.368 --> 00:19.037
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.664 --> 00:22.624
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.709 --> 00:23.959
could stop them.

00:24.043 --> 00:25.585
But when the world needed him most,

00:25.670 --> 00:26.795
he vanished.

00:27.463 --> 00:28.672
100 years passed,

00:28.756 --> 00:31.008
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar,

00:31.092 --> 00:32.884
an airbender named Aang.

00:32.969 --> 00:35.095
And although
his airbending skills are great,

00:35.179 --> 00:38.473
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

00:38.975 --> 00:41.935
But I believe Aang can save the world.

01:16.763 --> 01:18.722
Absolutely not.

01:18.806 --> 01:21.183
The Yuyan archers stay here.

01:21.267 --> 01:24.102
Your request is denied,
Commander Zhao.

01:24.395 --> 01:27.814
Colonel Shinu, please reconsider.

01:28.149 --> 01:30.025
Their precision is legendary.

01:30.109 --> 01:33.070
The Yuyan can pin a fly
to a tree from 100 yards away

01:33.154 --> 01:34.696
without killing it.

01:37.116 --> 01:40.702
You're wasting their talents
using them as mere security guards.

01:40.787 --> 01:43.330
I can do whatever I want
with their talents.

01:43.414 --> 01:46.291
They're my archers,
and what I say goes.

01:46.542 --> 01:48.377
But my search for the Avatar is--

01:48.461 --> 01:50.879
Is nothing but a vanity project.

01:51.047 --> 01:52.881
We're fighting a real war here,

01:52.965 --> 01:55.467
and I need every man
I've got, commander.

01:55.551 --> 01:56.593
But--

01:56.677 --> 01:57.677
That's final!

01:57.762 --> 01:59.638
I don't want to hear
another word about it.

02:11.442 --> 02:13.485
News from Fire Lord Ozai?

02:14.695 --> 02:16.822
It appears I've been
promoted to admiral.

02:17.407 --> 02:20.617
My request is now an order.

02:42.223 --> 02:43.723
This should bring your fever down.

02:45.059 --> 02:47.602
You know what I love
about Appa the most?

02:47.937 --> 02:49.312
His sense of humor.

02:49.605 --> 02:50.689
That's nice.

02:50.773 --> 02:51.773
I'll tell him.

02:53.651 --> 02:54.651
Ha ha ha!

02:54.735 --> 02:56.027
Classic Appa.

02:56.112 --> 02:57.195
How's Sokka doing?

02:57.280 --> 02:58.488
Not so good.

02:58.573 --> 02:59.781
Being out in that storm

02:59.866 --> 03:00.907
really did a number on him.

03:04.495 --> 03:06.705
I couldn't find
any ginger root for the tea,

03:06.789 --> 03:08.248
but I found a map.

03:08.332 --> 03:09.583
There's a herbalist institute

03:09.667 --> 03:11.084
on the top of that mountain.

03:11.169 --> 03:12.961
We could probably
find a cure for Sokka there.

03:13.379 --> 03:15.630
Aang, he's in no condition to travel.

03:15.715 --> 03:17.340
Sokka just needs more rest.

03:17.592 --> 03:19.426
I'm sure he'll be better by tomorrow.

03:23.723 --> 03:24.890
Not you, too.

03:25.224 --> 03:27.184
Relax. It was just a little cough.

03:27.268 --> 03:28.268
I'm fin--

03:34.859 --> 03:36.568
That's how Sokka started yesterday.

03:36.652 --> 03:37.819
Now look at him.

03:37.904 --> 03:39.362
He thinks he's an earthbender.

03:39.780 --> 03:41.948
Take that, you rock.

03:43.075 --> 03:45.535
A few more hours
and you'll be talking nonsense, too.

03:45.620 --> 03:46.995
I'm going to find some medicine.

03:53.544 --> 03:56.379
Maybe it's safer if I go on foot.

03:56.464 --> 03:57.797
Keep an eye on them, guys.

04:00.426 --> 04:01.635
Ha ha!

04:01.719 --> 04:03.178
You guys are killing me.

04:15.942 --> 04:18.860
We haven't been able to pick up
the Avatar's trail since the storm,

04:19.320 --> 04:21.905
but if we continue
heading northeast...

04:23.574 --> 04:24.741
What do they want?

04:24.825 --> 04:27.911
Perhaps a sporting game of Pai Sho.

04:33.292 --> 04:34.501
The hunt for the Avatar

04:34.585 --> 04:35.961
has been given prime importance.

04:36.379 --> 04:37.921
All information regarding the Avatar

04:38.005 --> 04:40.257
must be reported
directly to Admiral Zhao.

04:40.758 --> 04:42.592
Zhao has been promoted?

04:42.677 --> 04:44.886
Well, good for him.

04:45.763 --> 04:47.973
I've got nothing to report to Zhao.

04:48.057 --> 04:50.517
Now get off my ship and let us pass.

04:51.102 --> 04:52.769
Admiral Zhao is not allowing ships

04:52.853 --> 04:54.396
in or out of this area.

04:55.106 --> 04:56.690
Off my ship!

04:57.441 --> 04:58.942
Excellent.

04:59.944 --> 05:01.528
I take the pot.

05:02.321 --> 05:04.072
But you're all improving.

05:04.156 --> 05:07.075
I'm certain you will win
if we play again.

05:13.165 --> 05:15.667
It says here
that the Avatar can create tornadoes

05:15.751 --> 05:17.168
and run faster than the wind.

05:17.253 --> 05:18.670
Pretty amazing.

05:18.754 --> 05:21.881
Aw, that's just a bunch
of Fire Lord propaganda.

05:21.966 --> 05:23.633
There's no way that's true.

05:38.858 --> 05:42.277
Katara, please, water.

05:42.361 --> 05:44.654
Listen carefully, Momo.

05:44.739 --> 05:48.908
I need you to take this
to the river and fill it with water.

05:54.165 --> 05:55.165
Got it?

06:14.602 --> 06:16.478
Hello. I'm sorry
to barge in like this,

06:16.562 --> 06:18.521
but I need some medicine
for my friends.

06:18.606 --> 06:20.106
They have fevers
and they've been coughing--

06:20.191 --> 06:22.108
Settle down, young man.

06:22.193 --> 06:25.111
Your friends are going to be fine.

06:25.404 --> 06:29.157
I've been up here
for over 40 years, you know.

06:29.241 --> 06:32.702
Used to be others,
but they all left years ago.

06:33.037 --> 06:35.872
Now it's just me and Miyuki.

06:36.666 --> 06:37.791
That's nice.

06:37.875 --> 06:42.128
Wounded Earth Kingdom troops
still come by now and again.

06:42.213 --> 06:43.838
Brave boys,

06:43.923 --> 06:45.882
and thanks to my remedies,

06:45.966 --> 06:49.469
they always leave in better shape
than when they arrived.

06:49.804 --> 06:51.429
That's nice. Are you almost done?

06:51.806 --> 06:52.889
Hold on.

06:52.973 --> 06:55.892
I just need to add
one last ingredient.

06:56.602 --> 06:58.645
Sandalwood?

06:58.729 --> 07:00.939
Yes-- No, that won't do.

07:01.023 --> 07:03.108
Banana leaf? Nope.

07:03.526 --> 07:04.859
Ginger root?

07:06.112 --> 07:08.279
Where is that pesky little plant?

07:15.413 --> 07:16.871
Is everything ok?

07:17.373 --> 07:19.082
It's been almost an hour

07:19.166 --> 07:21.751
and you haven't given
the men an order.

07:22.086 --> 07:23.336
I don't care what they do.

07:23.754 --> 07:25.547
Don't give up hope yet.

07:25.631 --> 07:28.133
You can still find the Avatar
before Zhao.

07:28.634 --> 07:29.759
How, uncle?

07:29.844 --> 07:30.844
With Zhao's resources,

07:30.928 --> 07:32.178
it's just a matter of time

07:32.263 --> 07:33.680
before he captures the Avatar.

07:34.140 --> 07:37.225
My honor, my throne, my country--

07:37.309 --> 07:38.852
I'm about to lose them all.

07:41.814 --> 07:44.649
Here's what I was looking for.

07:45.192 --> 07:46.943
Plum blossom.

07:47.862 --> 07:50.238
Finally. Thanks for all your help.

07:50.322 --> 07:51.322
Hands off.

07:51.407 --> 07:53.241
What do you think you're doing?

07:53.325 --> 07:54.617
Taking the cure to my friends.

07:55.119 --> 07:57.454
Ha ha! This isn't a cure.

07:57.538 --> 07:59.289
It's Miyuki's dinner.

07:59.540 --> 08:02.000
Plum blossom is her favorite.

08:02.084 --> 08:03.626
What about my friends?

08:03.711 --> 08:07.338
Well, all they need
is some frozen wood frogs.

08:07.423 --> 08:09.758
There's plenty of them
down in the valley swamp.

08:10.050 --> 08:12.260
What am I supposed to do
with frozen frogs?

08:12.344 --> 08:14.387
Why, suck on them, of course.

08:15.014 --> 08:16.097
Suck on them?

08:16.182 --> 08:18.600
The frog skin excretes a substance

08:18.684 --> 08:20.310
that'll cure your friends,

08:20.394 --> 08:22.437
but make sure you get plenty.

08:22.855 --> 08:24.731
Once those little critters thaw out,

08:24.815 --> 08:25.899
they're useless.

08:27.735 --> 08:29.110
You're insane, aren't you?

08:29.195 --> 08:30.653
That's right.

08:32.239 --> 08:34.407
Well, don't stand there all day.

08:34.492 --> 08:36.034
Go!

08:39.497 --> 08:40.497
Whoa!

08:53.260 --> 08:55.261
I think you dropped this.

09:07.233 --> 09:08.650
Aah!

09:49.233 --> 09:50.275
A frog!

10:30.357 --> 10:32.692
So this is the great Avatar,

10:32.776 --> 10:35.528
master of all the elements.

10:36.030 --> 10:37.947
I don't know how
you've managed to elude

10:38.032 --> 10:40.199
the Fire Nation for 100 years,

10:40.492 --> 10:44.287
but your little game
of hide and seek is over.

10:44.538 --> 10:45.997
I've never hidden from you.

10:46.081 --> 10:47.916
Untie me and I'll fight you right now.

10:48.292 --> 10:50.084
No.

10:50.669 --> 10:54.797
Tell me, how does it feel
to be the only airbender left?

10:55.424 --> 10:57.508
Do you miss your people?

10:58.594 --> 11:00.428
Don't worry.

11:00.512 --> 11:02.347
You won't be killed like they were.

11:02.973 --> 11:05.016
See, if you die, you'll just be reborn

11:05.100 --> 11:06.392
and the Fire Nation will have to begin

11:06.477 --> 11:09.062
its search for the Avatar
all over again.

11:09.521 --> 11:13.816
So I'll keep you alive,
but just barely.

11:20.032 --> 11:21.699
Blow all the wind you want.

11:21.784 --> 11:23.952
Your situation is futile.

11:24.036 --> 11:25.912
There is no escaping this fortress

11:26.413 --> 11:29.749
and no one is coming to rescue you.

11:36.590 --> 11:37.882
Water.

11:37.967 --> 11:40.343
Momo should be back any minute.

11:46.350 --> 11:47.684
No, Momo.

11:47.768 --> 11:48.977
Water.

11:49.478 --> 11:50.895
Wa-ter.

11:54.024 --> 11:57.443
Aang, what in the world
is taking you so long?

12:31.186 --> 12:45.491
All clear.

12:45.576 --> 12:46.576
Go on in.

13:07.473 --> 13:12.769
We are the sons and daughters
of fire, the superior element,

13:12.853 --> 13:17.023
until today, only one thing
stood in our path to victory--

13:17.107 --> 13:18.399
The Avatar!

13:18.692 --> 13:23.237
I am here to tell you
that he is now my prisoner!

13:26.241 --> 13:30.953
This is the year Sozin's Comet
returns to grant us its power!

13:33.165 --> 13:35.500
This is the year the Fire Nation

13:35.584 --> 13:38.211
breaks through
the walls of Ba Sing Se,

13:38.295 --> 13:40.880
and burns the city to the ground.

13:59.608 --> 14:01.025
What? No!

14:01.110 --> 14:03.903
Don't leave, frogs. My friends
are sick and they need you.

14:04.238 --> 14:06.072
Please go back to being frozen.

15:03.130 --> 15:10.761
Aah!

15:21.023 --> 15:23.357
Who are you? What's going on?

15:23.775 --> 15:25.067
Are you here to rescue me?

15:27.779 --> 15:29.280
I'll take that as a yes.

15:35.537 --> 15:36.537
My frogs!

15:36.622 --> 15:37.622
Come back!

15:37.706 --> 15:39.332
And stop thawing out!

15:40.375 --> 15:41.500
Wait!

15:41.585 --> 15:44.086
My friends need to
suck on those frogs!

15:50.636 --> 15:53.512
How many times
do I have to tell you, Momo?

15:53.597 --> 15:54.972
We need water.

15:55.349 --> 15:57.308
Wa-ter.

15:58.477 --> 15:59.769
Forget it.

16:00.437 --> 16:02.480
Aang, please hurry.

16:02.898 --> 16:05.733
Who is this Aang kid
you keep talking about, your highness?

16:33.011 --> 16:35.388
I want a full transcription
of my speech

16:35.472 --> 16:36.806
sent to the Fire Lord,

16:37.140 --> 16:39.267
Along with glowing testimonials

16:39.351 --> 16:41.936
from all of the ranking officers
present, and--

16:53.240 --> 16:56.701
Sir, shall I hold off
sending that speech to the Fire Lord?

17:05.210 --> 17:07.044
There. On the wall!

17:08.213 --> 17:09.338
Aah!

17:14.511 --> 17:16.554
The Avatar has escaped!

17:16.722 --> 17:18.764
Close all the gates immediately.

17:19.683 --> 17:21.225
Stay close to me.

18:07.522 --> 18:21.786
Aah!

18:45.018 --> 18:46.602
Take this.

18:47.062 --> 18:48.604
Jump on my back!

18:55.487 --> 18:56.654
Give me the next one!

19:14.131 --> 19:15.881
Hold your fire!

19:16.425 --> 19:18.467
The Avatar must be captured alive.

19:25.350 --> 19:26.434
Open the gate.

19:26.893 --> 19:28.436
Admiral, what are you doing?

19:28.520 --> 19:29.562
Let them out.

19:29.646 --> 19:30.646
Now!

19:33.942 --> 19:35.526
How could you let them go?

19:35.610 --> 19:40.197
A situation like this requires...
Precision.

19:54.963 --> 19:56.297
Do you have a clear shot?

19:58.508 --> 19:59.884
Knock out the thief.

20:00.510 --> 20:04.096
I'll deliver him to the Fire Lord
along with the Avatar.

20:19.112 --> 20:20.529
Quick! Recover the Avatar!

21:05.116 --> 21:06.325
You know what the worst part

21:06.409 --> 21:08.827
about being born
over 100 years ago is?

21:09.371 --> 21:11.372
I miss all the friends
I used to hang out with.

21:11.790 --> 21:13.374
Before the war started,

21:13.458 --> 21:15.668
I used to always
visit my friend, Kuzon.

21:15.752 --> 21:17.670
The two of us, we'd get in and out

21:17.754 --> 21:20.130
of so much trouble together.

21:20.215 --> 21:22.758
He was one of the best friends
I ever had...

21:22.842 --> 21:25.886
And he was from the Fire Nation,
just like you.

21:26.513 --> 21:28.097
If we knew each other back then,

21:28.181 --> 21:30.057
do you think
we could have been friends, too?

21:52.080 --> 21:53.956
Where have you been, Prince Zuko?

21:54.040 --> 21:55.624
You missed music night.

21:55.959 --> 21:59.670
Lieutenant Jee sang
a stirring love song.

22:00.005 --> 22:01.755
I'm going to bed.

22:01.840 --> 22:02.965
No disturbances.

22:15.061 --> 22:16.186
Suck on these.

22:16.271 --> 22:17.605
It'll make you feel better.

22:20.233 --> 22:22.860
Aang, how was your trip?

22:22.944 --> 22:24.862
Did you make any new friends?

22:25.155 --> 22:26.155
No.

22:26.239 --> 22:27.281
I don't think I did.

22:45.258 --> 22:46.967
This is tasty.

22:50.221 --> 22:51.221
Ptooey!

22:51.306 --> 22:52.348
Aah!
